flowchart TD
    A[User submits 5-field form] --> B[Validate inputs]
    B --> C[Retrieve comparable cases<br/>from Chroma vector store]
    C --> D{Privacy posture?}
    D -->|standard| E[Keep all matched tools]
    D -->|regulated| F[Strip non-governable tools]
    E --> G[Rank tools by evidence frequency]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Estimate cost:<br/>1 primary API + 1 assistant<br/>seats capped at fixed ceiling]
    H --> H2{Within stated budget?}
    H2 -->|yes| I[LLM writes prose summary<br/>tools/prices already decided]
    H2 -->|no| I
    I --> J[Render 3-block blueprint<br/>honestly flags over-budget result]
    J --> K[Export + trust survey]
